        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: The Nativity Story\n- People: Catherine Hardwicke, Keisha Castle-Hughes, Oscar Isaac\n- Companies: Temple Hill Entertainment\n- Awards: Academy Award for Best Actress, Broadcast Film Critics Association Awards\n\nFacts:\n- In 2004, Keisha Castle-Hughes won a Broadcast Film Critics Association Award for Best Young Actor/Actress.\n- Keisha Castle-Hughes was nominated for an Academy Award for Best Actress and was, at the time, the youngest person nominated in that category.\n- In 2006, The Nativity Story was released as a biblical drama film based on the nativity of Jesus.\n- In 2006, The Nativity Story was directed by Catherine Hardwicke and starred Keisha Castle-Hughes and Oscar Isaac.\n- In 2006, Temple Hill Entertainment produced The Nativity Story as its first film company production.",
